# Base stack

| Tool | Version / constraint |
|------|---------------------|
| Astro | 7.x |
| `@astrojs/vercel` | pinned exactly (no caret) |
| TypeScript | 6.x (not 7 — `@astrojs/check` peer bound) |
| Tailwind CSS | 4.x via `@tailwindcss/vite` |
| Node.js | even majors only (22, 24, …); build machine sets Vercel runtime |
| pnpm | 11.x; lockfile committed |

## Package manager

- Always use **pnpm**, never npm or yarn
- First-time setup: **`pnpm run setup`** (not `pnpm setup` — shadows pnpm's built-in command)
- Install: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` in CI
- Settings live in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, not `package.json#pnpm`
- CI: `pnpm/action-setup@v4` must **not** set `version:` — use `package.json#packageManager` only (see docs/DEVIATIONS.md D-29)

## Config files

- `astro.config.ts` — not `.mjs`; imports locale list from `src/config/locales.ts`
- `eslint.config.js` — flat config, ESLint 10
- No `tailwind.config.js` — tokens in `src/styles/global.css`

## Integrations

- `@astrojs/tailwind` is incompatible with Astro 7 — do not add it
- Email: provider-agnostic `fetch` stub until wired (ADR-0002 pattern)
- OG images: `@vercel/og` on Node serverless; `@types/react` dev-only (ADR-0003)
